      "section_kind": "volume",
      "volume_candidate": 12,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "二月乙未朔，廢景泰帝為郕王。庚子，高穀致仕。湯序請除景泰年號，不許。癸卯，吏部侍郎李賢兼翰林學士，入閣預機務。殺都督范廣。戊申，柳溥破廣西蠻。癸丑，郕王薨。戊午，方瑛、石璞大破湖廣苗。召璞還。壬戌，免南畿被災秋糧。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "flags": [],
      "locator": {
        "source_file": "resources/originals/twenty-four-histories/24明史-EPUB全文.txt",
